  "job_B19.5_20251003_114444": {
    "chunk_text": "18 \u00dea eode se lig of \u00feam ofne ond forb\u00e6rnde hi begen, ond hire he ne sce\u00feede. SE16A20 \u00deisse f\u00e6mnan lichoma restet neah Calcidonia \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre, ond ure f\u00e6dras hi nemdon \u00fea SE19A1 On \u00f0one XVIIIIan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s bisceopes gemynd sancti Ianuari. SE19A2 Se \u00ferowode martyrdom for Criste in \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre Beneuentum ond his deaconas mid him, SE20A1 On \u00feone XX d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6mnan gemynd sancta Fausta ond sancti Efilasi. SE20A2 \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s se gerefa se \u00fee geheold \u00fea witu \u00fea se casere het don \u00fe\u00e6re halgan f\u00e6mnan Faustan. SE20A4 \u00dea gelyfde he gode for \u00feam wundrum \u00f0a he \u00fea geseah \u00e6t hire, ond he \u00f0a ge\u00ferowode SE21A1 On \u00f0one XXI d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles tid sanctus Matheus. SE21A2 Se w\u00e6s \u00e6rest mid Iudeum theloniarius, \u00fe\u00e6t is gafoles moniend ond wicgerefa, ac Crist hine SE21A4 Ond he wrat ealra manna \u00ebrest Cristes godspel mid Iudeum. SE21A6 Ond \u00e6fter Cristes upastignesse he gel\u00e6rde twua m\u00e6g\u00fea to godes geleafan, Macedonian \u00fea SE21A12 Ac hw\u00e6\u00f0re o\u00feer kyning w\u00e6s \u00e6fter \u00feam, se w\u00e6s on naman Hirtacus. SE21A14 He het \u00feisne Matheum hindan mid sweorde \u00feurhstingan, \u00fe\u00e6r he stod \u00e6tforan godes SE21A18 Ac Matheus him s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6",
